(5512274, 794964, 96462, '<td valign="top">This is just great.  I love the warm glow, which suggests that special warm relationship we all have with some people, yet there''s that playful element, as they''re having fun.  Really good angle too.  The tree looks like it might be distracting, but some how isn''t.  Like it a lot.  I guess to be very picky, it would have been nice if the boy on the right was more in the whiter light rather than the yellow, but minor minor point.</td>', 'This is just great.  I love the warm glow, which suggests that special warm relationship we all have with some people, yet there''s that playful element, as they''re having fun.  Really good angle too.  The tree looks like it might be distracting, but some how isn''t.  Like it a lot.  I guess to be very picky, it would have been nice if the boy on the right was more in the whiter light rather than the yellow, but minor minor point.', '2009-06-03 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
