(5514615, 795647, 103032, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snap shot.  I think it would have been better to compose the shot, have both bride and groom in focus, and have the face of the bride in the shot.  The lighting is nice, not harsh, very neutral. The DOF is good, having the background blurred.  It''s a good subject for the challenge.  Just my honest critique.</td>', 'This looks like a snap shot.  I think it would have been better to compose the shot, have both bride and groom in focus, and have the face of the bride in the shot.  The lighting is nice, not harsh, very neutral. The DOF is good, having the background blurred.  It''s a good subject for the challenge.  Just my honest critique.', '2009-06-04 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5514631, 794374, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like it for the subject. The lighting is nice.  "Best Friend" is nice and crisply focused.  Nice capture of Mom''s smile, it shows she is loving being a mom.  I even like it that Mom is out of focus, just wish that mom''s entire head was in the shot and not cut off.  With that said, if the original has mom''s entire head, maybe try a square crop/framing with mom''s entire head.  I think that would be a great shot.  IMHO</td>', 'I like it for the subject. The lighting is nice.  "Best Friend" is nice and crisply focused.  Nice capture of Mom''s smile, it shows she is loving being a mom.  I even like it that Mom is out of focus, just wish that mom''s entire head was in the shot and not cut off.  With that said, if the original has mom''s entire head, maybe try a square crop/framing with mom''s entire head.  I think that would be a great shot.  IMHO', '2009-06-04 20:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
