(5519109, 795816, 75034, '<td valign="top">I was asked by my friend Coley, to try and find his photo in the Friends challenge after finding his Free study. After careful consideration, OK who am I kidding, I saw this one and moved no further. Coley I think this one is yours, it has your style and sence of hunor attached to it, not to mention the dance element. The focus is spot on, the composition and timing are perfect. I''m sure you had fun doing this and it sure looks like the models did. I do hope I''m right and if not well then, the photographer can take comfert in knowing that they are develiping a style of photography that rivels one of the best on this site.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a great shot and I hope you do well with it.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'I was asked by my friend Coley, to try and find his photo in the Friends challenge after finding his Free study. After careful consideration, OK who am I kidding, I saw this one and moved no further. Coley I think this one is yours, it has your style and sence of hunor attached to it, not to mention the dance element. The focus is spot on, the composition and timing are perfect. I''m sure you had fun doing this and it sure looks like the models did. I do hope I''m right and if not well then, the photographer can take comfert in knowing that they are develiping a style of photography that rivels one of the best on this site. Congratulations on a great shot and I hope you do well with it. MAX!', '2009-06-08 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
