(5522779, 796221, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I swear the script is working so that all your images come to me!<br/> <br/>This seems to have placed well for you.  Very good subject for the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>The composition is quite strong, but somehow I wonder if it could have been improved slightly by not having such a tight crop.  Perhaps a little bit space to the left of the frame would have helped.  <br/> <br/>The sort of sepia toning is quite effective.  The sky appears quite blown out but I don''t think that matters too much.  Probably cost you a bit in the score though.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club I swear the script is working so that all your images come to me! This seems to have placed well for you.  Very good subject for the challenge topic. The composition is quite strong, but somehow I wonder if it could have been improved slightly by not having such a tight crop.  Perhaps a little bit space to the left of the frame would have helped.   The sort of sepia toning is quite effective.  The sky appears quite blown out but I don''t think that matters too much.  Probably cost you a bit in the score though. ', '2009-06-10 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5522814, 794964, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Judi!!!  Well done!  :-)  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Congratulations Judi!!!  Well done!  :-)  Beautiful shot.', '2009-06-10 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
