(5524456, 794047, 101117, '<td valign="top">Just spotted this in the PostLuminous thread and I think it''s an amazing shot! It''s got so much more mood and feeling than most of the shots entered for this challenge and I think it definitely deserves to be sitting well ahead of all the ''silhoueted people on the horizon'' shots!<br/> <br/>I think you''re score probably suffered because it''s the kind of shot you need to take the time to look at to appreciate.</td>', 'Just spotted this in the PostLuminous thread and I think it''s an amazing shot! It''s got so much more mood and feeling than most of the shots entered for this challenge and I think it definitely deserves to be sitting well ahead of all the ''silhoueted people on the horizon'' shots! I think you''re score probably suffered because it''s the kind of shot you need to take the time to look at to appreciate.', '2009-06-11 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
