(5525874, 795371, 69008, '<td valign="top">We can''t always set up the shot with animals and birds, but you nailed the perfect pose and a couple of beautiful, healthy looking, blue and gold macaws with this shot.  Bumping the saturation and contrast up a little, and using levels at the dark end a little to remove the light sheen, would have helped the texture in the blue feathers.  The limb at shoulder level probably hurt this shot in voting, but there is not much that can be done with basic edit for that problem.</td>', 'We can''t always set up the shot with animals and birds, but you nailed the perfect pose and a couple of beautiful, healthy looking, blue and gold macaws with this shot.  Bumping the saturation and contrast up a little, and using levels at the dark end a little to remove the light sheen, would have helped the texture in the blue feathers.  The limb at shoulder level probably hurt this shot in voting, but there is not much that can be done with basic edit for that problem.', '2009-06-12 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
